From 7dbafe2cb0d3ad063f501e9c0d53ba1ebcfc700e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yzddmr6 <46088090+yzddmr6@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 22:44:32 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] battery: Show temperature when available

Read power_supply temperatures in tenths of a degree Celsius for each
battery on every refresh. Use the existing temperature unit preference
and translation, and hide the row when a reading is unavailable.

Test separate batteries, negative and zero temperatures, changing
readings, malformed values and a missing attribute with fake sysfs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 data/resources/ui/pages/battery.ui | 10 ++++++++++
 src/devices/battery.rs             | 30 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/ui/pages/battery.rs            | 15 ++++++++++++++-
 3 files changed, 54 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

